INSERT INTO posts (id, slug, title, excerpt, body, date_label, image_data_url, thumbnail_data_url, published, category_id, locale, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT 'f6274ef7-4bd9-4fbe-9aea-69e2bceeb9c0', 'clientes-internacionales-costa-blanca', 'International Clients on the Costa Blanca: The Same First-Class Service, No Exceptions', 'At Limpiezas Luz de Luna we treat every client with the same respect and professionalism, regardless of origin. Here''s how we care for the homes of our large international community on the Costa Blanca.', '## A Costa Blanca with neighbours from all over the world

The Costa Blanca — Benidorm, Altea, Calpe, Moraira, Jávea — has for decades been one of the favourite destinations for the international community in Spain: British, German, Scandinavian, Dutch, Belgian, Russian, Ukrainian and many other nationalities have chosen these shores to live year-round or to enjoy a second home by the Mediterranean. To us, they are neighbours like any other: clients who deserve the same care, the same punctuality and the same spotless cleaning we have been delivering for more than 35 years.

## The same service, no exceptions

At Limpiezas Luz de Luna we make no distinctions. Every quote, every visit and every window gets the same attention to detail, wherever the client comes from. Our commitment is simple: professionalism, respect and flawless results across the whole Costa Blanca, whatever language is spoken at home.

### What our international clients value most

- **Discretion and trust.** Many of these homes stay closed for much of the year. We look after every access point as if it were our own home.
- **Punctuality and consistency.** A maintenance schedule that is kept, visit after visit, whether the owner is in Spain or not.
- **Clear communication.** Detailed quotes, photos of the finished work, and availability to answer questions — including for those who prefer to communicate in writing.
- **Streak-free results.** Large sea-view windows demand a flawless finish: we use reverse-osmosis water so that neither the sun nor the sea salt leaves a single mark.

## Sea-view villas: a challenge and a passion

Homes in this community often stand out for their large windows, pool terraces and glass façades — like the villa overlooking Altea in the photograph. These are large panes, often at height, which require a professional technique: carbon-fibre poles, pure reverse-osmosis water and a trained eye to leave every surface perfectly clear.

### What our service for second homes includes

- Full cleaning of exterior and interior windows, at height and at street level.
- Maintenance of window frames, sills and glass sliding curtains.
- Periodic maintenance plans for owners who don''t live in Spain all year round.
- Coordination with property managers or estate administrators.
- No-obligation quote in under 24 hours.

## Professionalism, whatever the circumstances

We know many of our international clients spend long periods away from Spain, managing their property from a distance. At Limpiezas Luz de Luna, that changes nothing about how we work: every client is a person who trusts us with the care of their home, and that trust is earned through actions, not words. We keep cleaning windows in Benidorm, Altea, Calpe and across the Costa Blanca with the same dedication as always.

## How to request a quote

If you own a home on the Costa Blanca and are looking for a reliable, punctual window cleaning service you can trust whether you''re in Spain or abroad, get in touch. We''ll send you a free, no-obligation quote in under 24 hours, in whichever language suits you best.', 'September 23, 2026', (SELECT image_data_url FROM posts WHERE slug = 'clientes-internacionales-costa-blanca' AND locale = 'es'), (SELECT thumbnail_data_url FROM posts WHERE slug = 'clientes-internacionales-costa-blanca' AND locale = 'es'), 1, '6380b22a541246dab0670eab030366bb', 'en', '2026-09-23 16:40:34', '2026-09-23 16:47:35'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM posts WHERE slug = 'clientes-internacionales-costa-blanca' AND locale = 'en');

